CALL newPutForth(62, 1, 'Earmarking revenue for a program just guarantees it gets funded whether it works or not. That\'s not accountability — it\'s politicians protecting their pet projects from scrutiny.');
CALL newPutForth(63, 1, 'Government\'s been too timid on deregulation for decades. If we\'ve been undershooting free-market reforms, overshoot the correction. Half-measures just slow the decline.');
CALL newPutForth(226, 1, 'Liberty is non-negotiable. Government doesn\'t grant you rights — you\'re born with them. The moment you accept \'some\' restrictions on freedom, you\'ve opened the floodgates.');
